sequenceDiagram
    participant UI as Frontend
    participant GW as Gateway
    participant Redis as Redis session
    participant API as AI service
    participant Graph as LangGraph or agent call
    participant Agent as Agent function
    participant LLM as ChatGroq
    participant Tool as YouTube API helper
    participant DB as MongoDB
    UI->>GW: Credentialed AI API request
    GW->>Redis: Validate session (protected routes)
    Redis-->>GW: Session/user
    GW->>API: Proxy + x-user-id
    API->>Graph: Invoke graph / direct agent
    Graph->>Agent: Run node agent
    Agent->>LLM: Prompt invocation
    LLM-->>Agent: Model response
    opt Roadmap resource enrichment
        Agent->>Tool: Search video by module
        Tool-->>Agent: Video URL or null
    end
    Agent-->>Graph: Parsed/processed result
    Graph-->>API: Final graph state
    API->>DB: Persist user result
    DB-->>API: Saved document
    API-->>GW: HTTP response
    GW-->>UI: JSON response
